#{{IF deploymentStrategy.mode == 'brownfield'}}
## Brownfield

This tenant already contains resources. Run the `brownfield-discovery` workflow
before the first plan — it is read-only and produces an assessment plus import
blocks for review. The destroy-protection gate fails any plan containing a
destroy or replace action unless the pull request carries the `approved-destroy`
label.
#{{ENDIF}}

## Working in this repository

Pull requests run `terraform plan` using a read-only identity. Merging to
`{{FACTORY-RAW:computed.defaultBranch}}` runs `terraform apply` per layer, in
dependency order, behind the environment approval gates.

A plan that destroys resources fails the pull request by default.

